{"id":"a16baab08ee28e51","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/880_范畴语法演算_Categorial_Grammar.md","title":"880 范畴语法演算 Categorial Grammar","display":"880_范畴语法演算_Categorial_Grammar","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"880-范畴语法演算-Categorial-Grammar\">880 范畴语法演算 Categorial Grammar</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限基本范畴集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Word}\">\\(\\mathsf{Word}\\)</span> 为词项集合，指定句子范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{At}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>。范畴构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fslash},\\operatorname{bslash}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A/B\">\\(A/B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\backslash A\">\\(B\\backslash A\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\)</span>。第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span> 后，词典为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lex}:\\mathsf{Word}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Cat}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Lex}:\\mathsf{Word}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Cat}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-范畴\">2. 范畴</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Cat},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\in\\mathsf{Cat}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)\\in\\mathsf{Cat}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由原子与替换\">3. 自由原子与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A))=\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A))=\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\times\\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fslash}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{fslash}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bslash}(B[\\sigma],A[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bslash}(B[\\sigma],A[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Cat}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CG}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-词串判断\">4. 词串判断</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}=\\mathsf{Word}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}=\\mathsf{Word}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\cdot v\">\\(u\\cdot v\\)</span>。判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}=\\{u\\Rightarrow A:u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Judg}=\\{u\\Rightarrow A:u\\in\\mathsf{Str},A\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-词典公理\">5. 词典公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lex}}=\n\\{(w)\\Rightarrow A:w\\in\\mathsf{Word},A\\in\\operatorname{Lex}(w)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lex}}=\n\\{(w)\\Rightarrow A:w\\in\\mathsf{Word},A\\in\\operatorname{Lex}(w)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lex}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{lex}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-应用规则\">6. 应用规则</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Judg}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Judg}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(\\mathsf{Judg}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span> 的子集；形式地约定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((J_0,\\ldots,J_{n-1});J):=((J_0,\\ldots,J_{n-1}),J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((J_0,\\ldots,J_{n-1});J):=((J_0,\\ldots,J_{n-1}),J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>前向应用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow B);u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{fslash}(A,B)),(v\\Rightarrow B);u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后向应用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow B),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\n=\n\\{((u\\Rightarrow B),(v\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{bslash}(B,A));u\\cdot v\\Rightarrow A):u,v\\in\\mathsf{Str},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Cat}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CG 在后文只使用两个函数应用规则；组合、类型提升与结构交换不作为规则关系出现。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-派生树\">7. 派生树</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\">\\(T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\\)</span>。定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 当且仅当：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(x)\\)</span> 无重复项；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in T\">\\(x,y\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(x)\\)</span> 中当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\prec x\">\\(y\\prec x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 不出现在任何子节点列中；\n每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne r\">\\(y\\ne r\\)</span> 恰出现在一个子节点列中；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无有向环；且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in T\">\\(y\\in T\\)</span> 都存在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x_0\\prec x_1\\prec\\cdots\\prec x_k=r\">\\(y=x_0\\prec x_1\\prec\\cdots\\prec x_k=r\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对任意有限非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in T\">\\(x\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span>，定义节点许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(x,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(x,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当满足下列两个互斥分支之一：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(x)=()\\wedge \\ell(x)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}(x)=()\\wedge \\ell(x)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\in T\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\in T\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ch}(x)=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ch}(x)=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\ell(x_0),\\ldots,\\ell(x_{n-1}));\\ell(x))\n\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\ell(x_0),\\ldots,\\ell(x_{n-1}));\\ell(x))\n\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CG 派生树是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span>，其中\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span>，并且每个节点均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):\n\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}),\\\n\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg},\\\n\\ell(r)=u\\Rightarrow A,\\\n\\forall x\\in T\\,\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(x,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\n\\{(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell):\n\\operatorname{OrdTree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}),\\\n\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Judg},\\\n\\ell(r)=u\\Rightarrow A,\\\n\\forall x\\in T\\,\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(x,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限证明对象纤维</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=(u\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\mathsf{Judg}\">\\(J=(u\\Rightarrow A)\\in\\mathsf{Judg}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(J)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(J)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导性与接受关系\">8. 可导性与接受关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}}(u,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\Longleftrightarrow u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\operatorname{atm}(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\Longleftrightarrow u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\operatorname{atm}(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导判断集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\n=\n\\{u\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Judg}:u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\n=\n\\{u\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Judg}:u\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标差异是：词典叶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\)</span> 只能通过前向应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;}\\)</span> 与后向应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;}\\)</span> 组成有限证明树；组合、类型提升和结构交换均不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>CG 的规则差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CG}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Word},s,\\mathsf{Cat},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Str},\\mathsf{Judg},\\operatorname{Lex},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{OrdTree},\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CG}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CG}}=\n(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Word},s,\\mathsf{Cat},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{Sub},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Str},\\mathsf{Judg},\\operatorname{Lex},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&gt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{&lt;},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{OrdTree},\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Der}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Sent}_{\\mathsf{CG}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CG}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义基本范畴语法演算的词典派生关系；不含语义组合、组合规则、类型提升或统计解析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"880-范畴语法演算-Categorial-Grammar","text":"880 范畴语法演算 Categorial Grammar","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-范畴","text":"2. 范畴","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由原子与替换","text":"3. 自由原子与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-词串判断","text":"4. 词串判断","level":1},{"id":"5.-词典公理","text":"5. 词典公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-应用规则","text":"6. 应用规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-派生树","text":"7. 派生树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导性与接受关系","text":"8. 可导性与接受关系","level":1},{"id